      "message": "Oops, ya, you\u0027re right.  The question is then will this break any NetworkFactory by putting it into a loop where it doesn\u0027t know ahead of time whether a network can satisfy a request, so it brings it up only to find it can\u0027t satisfy the requests and is unneeded, then brings it down and loops.",
